is_a: UBERON:0022303 ! nervous system cell part layer
intersection_of: UBERON:0022303 ! nervous system cell part layer
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0001945 ! superior colliculus
relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0001945 ! superior colliculus
property_value: prefLabel "layer of superior colliculus" xsd:string
property_value: UBPROP:0000008 "The tectum in lampreys has more layers than the tectum in hagfishes, likely related to the fact that vision is less well developed in hagfishes. tectal lamination is almost identical in reptiles and birds and is more restricted in mammals[http://icb.oxfordjournals.org/content/42/4/743.full]" xsd:string

