relationship: RO:0002202 UBERON:0003894 {source="EHDAA2"} ! liver primordium
property_value: http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/depiction "http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/Gray1088.png" xsd:anyURI
property_value: prefLabel "hepatic diverticulum" xsd:string
property_value: UBPROP:0000008 "in mice, the hepatic diverticulum forms by E9 and expands into an obvious liver bud by E10" xsd:string
property_value: UBPROP:0000011 "The caudal part of the septum transversum is invaded by the hepatic diverticulum which divides within it to form the liver and thus gives rise to the ventral mesentery of the foregut." xsd:string

